use aws in eu-west-2

service api
  image a
service worker
  image b
database db is postgres
bucket uploads
queue jobs
load balancer web
  listen on 80
  send / to api

api connects to db
api connects to worker
api reads uploads
api writes uploads
api reads and writes uploads
api reads jobs
api sends to jobs
worker reads jobs

api connects to db
api connects to api
db connects to api
uploads reads db
web connects to api
api writes jobs
api reads and writes jobs
api connects to jobs
api sends to uploads
api connects to uploads
api reads db
api connects to web
